WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:23.842
"Whoa! The soccer ball turned into a giant spider!"

2
00:00:24.263 --> 00:00:25.303
cried a human boy.

3
00:00:25.323 --> 00:00:27.825
"It's going to attack us!"

4
00:00:28.265 --> 00:00:29.026
cried a girl.

5
00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:32.088
"Run for your lives!"

6
00:00:32.652 --> 00:00:33.613
cried another kid.

7
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:37.615
The human soccer players sprinted off the field and hid.

8
00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:41.377
All around Ben, human kids leaped up.

9
00:00:42.457 --> 00:00:45.439
They pushed and shoved as they rushed down the bleachers' steps.

10
00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:49.261
"This is terrible!"

11
00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:51.742
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands.

12
00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:55.264
"Everything is totally out of control!"

13
00:00:56.345 --> 00:00:58.246
The spider charged up the field.

14
00:00:59.627 --> 00:01:01.588
Ben noticed that it was growing bigger.

15
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.742
Ben and his friends ran down to the field.

16
00:01:06.342 --> 00:01:08.204
Several teachers chased the spider.

17
00:01:09.005 --> 00:01:13.568
But every time someone got close to the giant creature, it shot sticky webs.

18
00:01:13.588 --> 00:01:16.150
"Aargh!" shouted Mr.

19
00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:18.732
Gwarg as a large web stuck to his face.

20
00:01:19.753 --> 00:01:23.096
Miss Bungle hopped onto her broom and flew after the spider.

21
00:01:24.297 --> 00:01:28.160
The spider spun around and flung webs at the broom flying teacher.

22
00:01:29.081 --> 00:01:32.604
She lost control of her broom and slammed into the bleachers.

23
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.681
"This is outrageous!"

24
00:01:37.202 --> 00:01:38.403
shouted Mayor Hubbletree.

25
00:01:38.423 --> 00:01:43.528
"Freaky! You said we were going to have a friendly game of soccer!"

26
00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:47.071
Mr. Freaky didn't seem to know how to reply.

27
00:01:48.532 --> 00:01:51.175
He grabbed his handkerchief and blew his noses.

28
00:01:52.957 --> 00:01:55.279
"Students from People Place Middle School!"

29
00:01:55.679 --> 00:01:56.920
Mayor Hubbletree shouted.

30
00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:58.822
"Back on the bus!

31
00:01:59.042 --> 00:02:00.604
We're leaving this instant!"

32
00:02:05.468 --> 00:02:09.451
As Ben watched the humans leave, he noticed someone else running.

33
00:02:11.092 --> 00:02:12.452
It was a large troll.

34
00:02:14.013 --> 00:02:18.216
And she was wearing the same hoodie that the mystery girl and the squid had been wearing.

35
00:02:18.976 --> 00:02:21.138
Ben pointed out the troll to Waldo.

36
00:02:21.158 --> 00:02:26.101
"I think that troll made the ball turn into a spider."

37
00:02:26.121 --> 00:02:29.243
"What?" Waldo squinted at the troll.

38
00:02:29.263 --> 00:02:31.204
"Why do you think that?"

39
00:02:32.588 --> 00:02:37.629
"The troll is wearing the same hoodie that the mystery girl and the squid monster wore," Ben replied.

40
00:02:37.649 --> 00:02:40.490
"She must be in their gang!

41
00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.871
We have to stop them!"

42
00:02:42.691 --> 00:02:46.032
Ben shot after the troll, and Waldo hurried after him.

43
00:02:48.532 --> 00:02:50.673
The troll ran around an equipment shed.

44
00:02:50.693 --> 00:02:57.055
"I'll float through the shed and surprise the troll on the other side," thought Ben.

45
00:02:57.895 --> 00:03:06.046
He floated toward the shed, passing through one wall, then through all of the equipment, and then "Oh

46
00:03:06.126 --> 00:03:07.487
no!" cried Ben.

47
00:03:07.507 --> 00:03:09.067
"I'm stuck!"

48
00:03:10.588 --> 00:03:13.249
Ben was stuck halfway through the wall of the shed.

49
00:03:14.209 --> 00:03:18.251
He pushed and pulled and struggled to get out, but nothing worked.

50
00:03:20.712 --> 00:03:24.874
He watched helplessly as the troll ducked around a corner of the school building.

51
00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:27.015
Waldo hurried over.

52
00:03:27.035 --> 00:03:28.675
"Don't worry, Ben.

53
00:03:28.936 --> 00:03:29.576
I'll help you."

54
00:03:30.316 --> 00:03:34.699
But then the wizard slapped his forehead, causing his glasses to fall off.

55
00:03:34.719 --> 00:03:38.682
"Ugh. I don't have my spell book with me.

56
00:03:39.863 --> 00:03:42.725
I can't get you out of there without looking up the right spell."

57
00:03:42.745 --> 00:03:46.027
"Waldo, just try," Ben pleaded.

58
00:03:46.047 --> 00:03:48.408
"The troll is going to get away!"

59
00:03:49.309 --> 00:03:51.370
Waldo stooped down for his glasses.

60
00:03:52.091 --> 00:03:53.212
He put them back on.

61
00:03:53.232 --> 00:03:58.255
"I don't know I'm not very good at—" "You can do it!"

62
00:03:58.575 --> 00:03:59.076
said Ben.

63
00:04:00.032 --> 00:04:01.913
"Besides, what's the worst that can happen?

64
00:04:02.613 --> 00:04:03.973
I'm already stuck in a wall."

65
00:04:05.253 --> 00:04:06.654
Waldo took a deep breath.

66
00:04:06.674 --> 00:04:10.015
"Okay, I'll give it a try."

67
00:04:10.935 --> 00:04:12.515
The wizard thought for a moment.

68
00:04:14.976 --> 00:04:17.137
Then he muttered some words under his breath.

69
00:04:18.917 --> 00:04:22.018
Suddenly—pop! Ben flew out of the wall.

70
00:04:23.198 --> 00:04:24.899
Waldo blinked in astonishment.

71
00:04:24.919 --> 00:04:26.919
"It worked!"

72
00:04:27.259 --> 00:04:27.819
he cried.

73
00:04:27.839 --> 00:04:32.045
"I can't believe it—I did a spell without my spell book!"

74
00:04:32.765 --> 00:04:36.407
He jumped up and down, causing his glasses to fall off again.

75
00:04:36.427 --> 00:04:38.948
"Awesome!" said Ben.

76
00:04:38.968 --> 00:04:40.929
"Now let's catch that troll!"

77
00:04:42.869 --> 00:04:46.291
They ran around the corner of the building and found a pink monster.

78
00:04:46.891 --> 00:04:49.492
Ben gasped when he realized what she was wearing.

79
00:04:49.512 --> 00:04:52.093
"The hoodie!"

80
00:04:52.393 --> 00:04:53.074
Ben cried.

81
00:04:53.094 --> 00:04:56.575
"She must be in the gang," said Waldo.

82
00:04:56.595 --> 00:04:58.216
"But where's the troll?"

83
00:04:59.136 --> 00:05:00.297
Ben glanced around.

84
00:05:01.297 --> 00:05:02.878
The troll was nowhere in sight.

85
00:05:02.898 --> 00:05:07.281
"I don't understand," he said.

86
00:05:07.301 --> 00:05:10.943
"Why would this monster stick around if the troll ran away?

87
00:05:12.624 --> 00:05:15.406
If they were in the same gang, they'd probably run away together."

88
00:05:16.766 --> 00:05:18.687
Suddenly Ben thought of something.

89
00:05:18.707 --> 00:05:21.709
"Maybe there isn't a gang at all."

90
00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.091
Waldo scratched his head.

91
00:05:24.111 --> 00:05:26.272
"What are you talking about?

92
00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.502
What about the other monsters and the mystery girl?"

93
00:05:29.522 --> 00:05:35.227
"I think this monster is all of them," said Ben.

94
00:05:35.247 --> 00:05:37.649
"I think she can change shape."

95
00:05:38.449 --> 00:05:39.690
The monster gasped.

96
00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.472
"Who are you?"

97
00:05:41.872 --> 00:05:43.033
Ben asked the monster.

98
00:05:43.934 --> 00:05:45.455
The monster didn't answer.

99
00:05:47.277 --> 00:05:48.598
Ben glanced at Waldo.

100
00:05:48.618 --> 00:05:50.860
"Do you know any spells that can help us?"

101
00:05:52.101 --> 00:05:55.704
"Yes," said Waldo without taking his eyes off the monster.

102
00:05:57.276 --> 00:06:00.557
"I know a spell that makes creatures reveal their true forms."

103
00:06:01.798 --> 00:06:02.438
He paused.

104
00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:04.839
"But I've never tried it."

105
00:06:04.859 --> 00:06:07.540
"You can do it, Waldo," said Ben.

106
00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:09.841
"You freed me from that wall."

107
00:06:12.002 --> 00:06:12.843
Waldo nodded.

108
00:06:12.863 --> 00:06:14.483
"You're right.

109
00:06:14.844 --> 00:06:16.224
I don't need my spell book.

110
00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:19.205
I am a very talented wizard!"

111
00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:28.442
He muttered some words under his breath and—poof!

112
00:06:28.582 --> 00:06:29.084
"Oh no!"

113
00:06:29.445 --> 00:06:30.147
cried Ben.

114
00:06:30.167 --> 00:06:34.180
"Moo!" said a cow.
